# The OEWS normalized snapshot is 12 MB — larger than the application itself.
# Its provenance lives in data/bls-oews/raw (the archives BLS served plus their
# digests) and its identity in data/bls-oews/manifest.json. Regenerate it with
# `npm run data:oews:rebuild`, which refuses to write a snapshot that does not
# hash to the promoted value.
data/bls-oews/snapshots/

# The CMS landscape archives are 72 MB of provider zips. Their provenance lives
# in data/cms-marketplace/raw/*.sha256 and in the rawSha256 the promoted index
# carries, so `npm run verify:cms` proves the committed snapshot against them
# whenever they are present and checks its own hashes when they are not.
# Re-download from https://www.cms.gov/marketplace/resources/data/public-use-files
data/cms-marketplace/raw/*.zip
